  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/resourcepacks/umbrella-villagers/logo.webp\" width=\"430\" alt=\"雨傘村民標誌\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">給村民一把雨傘！</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fresourcepacks%252fumbrella-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;line-height:40px;color:#1ea1f1;display:block\" rel=\"nofollow\">在我的網站上查看這個資源包！</a>\n  <br>\n  <p>這個資源包讓村民在下雨時會撐起雨傘！</p><p>共有24種不同的雨傘樣式，村民生成時可能是右手持傘或左手持傘！</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1300/705/group-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"群體\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1300/706/farm-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"耕作\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1300/707/under-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"傘下\"><br>\n  <br>\n    <div>⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯</div>\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入我的Discord伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fresourcepacks.ewanhowell.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\">\n    <div style=\"line-height:6px\"></div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:20px;text-decoration:underline;color:#5662f6\">加入資源包開發Discord伺服器！</p>\n  </a>\n  <div style=\"line-height:12px\"></div>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/